classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ initial design (Phase 1 draft)

    class Task {
        +str description
        +str time
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +date due_date
        +mark_complete() None
        +next_occurrence() Task
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +str breed
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +list_tasks() list~Task~
        +remove_task(task) None
    }

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +str preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +get_pet(name) Pet
        +get_all_tasks() list
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +sort_by_time(tasks) list
        +filter_tasks(pet_name, completed) list
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
        +process_recurring(task) Task
        +build_daily_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" --> "*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : reads